    <briefdescription>
<para>Strategy interface for adaptive compression selection. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implementations receive a <ref refid="structthemis_1_1_series_profile" kindref="compound">SeriesProfile</ref> (or raw DataPoints) and return the <ref refid="namespacethemis_1a8d703d274585c059c53eb99e50403e39" kindref="member">CompressionStrategy</ref> that is expected to yield the best trade-off between compression ratio and CPU cost for that series. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
